.TH SCHED_YIELD 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_yield \- yield the processor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_yield(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Relinquishes the calling thread's processor according to Linux scheduling rules.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set. Success leaves errno unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_yield (2)
